          "message": {
            "text": "Authentication bypass via forged JWT — Ruled out: JWT_SECRET JZAxtkdST1v-8SnLPBLEmwjRN4tCECEEz8SyDbe7qBA (HS256 token forgery)\n\nNo endpoint verifies JWTs. Forged HS256 tokens with role=admin, a token signed with a wrong secret, an expired token, `alg=none`, an empty cookie and a garbage cookie all produced the same outcome on /admin (all 403), /api/internal, /backup and /actuator (all 403). Response-size variation on /actuator/env, /debug and /api/status (368 vs 9588, 809 vs 10029, 235 vs 9455 bytes) reproduced identically with no cookie in 6/6 repeats, proving the variation is random server behaviour rather than token acceptance."
          },
          "locations": [
