        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/idor-object-level-authorization",
          "ruleIndex": 24,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "IDOR / object-level authorization — Ruled out: /api/query (id/user_id/table filtering)\n\nid, user_id, username, email, table, limit, offset, columns and path parameters are ignored: every value returns the same fixed result set as no parameter, so no per-object reference exists to manipulate. Object selection is only possible through the SQL predicate, which is covered by the SQL injection report (vuln-0008)."
