        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/bfla-injection-idor-on-evidence-submission-endpoint",
          "ruleIndex": 25,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "BFLA / injection / IDOR on evidence-submission endpoint — No issue identified: /api/bounty/submit\n\n403 at level 0 and 200 at level 1 (matching its documented gate). Accepts arbitrary JSON/form bodies but returns a static receipt (bounty_id, payout); SSTI payloads are not reflected or evaluated, path-traversal filenames have no effect, and no read-back route exists (/api/bounty/{id}, /api/bounties, /api/submissions all 404), so no unauthorized read/write or injection was demonstrated."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
