          "ruleIndex": 27,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Privilege escalation beyond level 1 — Ruled out: /api/auth (level 2/3/4 escalation)\n\nThe server re-validates user/os/work_dir/env values and rejects fabricated identities (status REJECTED, reason \"verification failed\"), leaving the client at level 1 on every attempt; level=4, step=4, force=1, debug=1, role=admin, admin=1, auth=4, array/duplicate parameters, JSON bodies, X-Forwarded-For/X-Auth-Level spoofing and cookie manipulation all failed to raise the level. Level 2+ requires genuine environment values by design, so no parameter-level escalation path exists."
          },
          "locations": [
